{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104880/extras/3.gif?t=1744437116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tear the World of Dreams to Pieces!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this hand painted indie puzzle game, you take on the role of Ksari, the god of dreams. Your task is to deconstruct dreams into pieces, like a reverse puzzle, and then assemble new ones from these pieces, helping sleeping characters understand themselves and overcome life challenges. The game combines a cute yet slightly eerie atmosphere and a storyline presented in comic book style.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104880/extras/123.png?t=1744437116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Mechanics: Not only do you search for items, but you also deconstruct dreams into components to find all hidden elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep Storyline: Each dream is a unique story where you, along with Ksari, help characters overcome their inner conflicts and find their way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Distinct Visual Style: Hand-drawn illustrations and an engaging comic book style give the game a special atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104880/extras/321.png?t=1744437116\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The World of Dreams Awaits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help characters find answers to important questions and experience an unforgettable journey through their dreams.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Besmir","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co